| Method        | Typical command                     | Common use                            |
| ------------- | ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Python `venv` | `python -m venv .venv`              | Standard Python projects              |
| `uv`          | `uv venv`                           | Fast modern Python workflow           |
| Conda         | `conda create -n myenv python=3.12` | Data science/ML environments          |
| Poetry        | `poetry install`                    | Dependency + project management       |
| Docker        | `docker build ...`                  | Production/containerized applications |


